            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display device includes: an organic light emitting panel (10) including a first display region, a second display region, and a bending region between the first display region and the second display region, the bending region including a folding hinge region with a folding hinge (300a); a first set frame (120) supporting the first display region; and a second set frame (140) supporting the second display region and adjacent to the first set frame (120) with the bending region interposed therebetween, wherein a side surface of the folding hinge (300a) and a side edge of the organic light emitting panel (10) are surrounded by a side cover (350) in the folding hinge region, wherein the folding hinge (300a) is formed of a metal material, and wherein the side cover (350) is formed of a plastic material.</p>
            </abstract>
